  "name": "managing-llm-prompts",
  "description": "Create, version, release, and wire up LLM prompts with PostHog prompt management. Use when a user asks to create or edit a prompt in PostHog, move hardcoded prompts out of their code, change a prompt without a deploy, release or roll back a prompt version with a label such as production, or fetch prompts at runtime with the Python or Node SDK. Covers the order of the llma-prompt tools, safe edits of existing prompts, labels as the release step, the fetch code with a fallback, and how to confirm that the application really fetches the prompt.",
